	)
	(text "Just be really careful that you distance the pin connectors precisely in PCB layout\n& Nothing is flipped, will connect to the right pins when the breakout board is plugged in.\nNOTE: Since we will be using the breakout board for DRV8833 we need 6pin on each side for a total of 12pins"
